WEBVTT

00:00:04.530 --> 00:00:09.730
After completing a painful battle in
the world of Cephiro, I, Fuu Hououji...

00:00:09.840 --> 00:00:12.900
...along with Ms. Hikaru Shidou
and Ms. Umi Ryuuzaki...

00:00:13.010 --> 00:00:13.140
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.

00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.110
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.
Autozam

00:00:15.110 --> 00:00:17.610
...was summoned back to Cephiro
from the memorable Tokyo Tower.
Eagle

00:00:17.610 --> 00:00:19.110
Geo Zazu

00:00:19.110 --> 00:00:19.610
There, three countries...
Geo Zazu

00:00:19.610 --> 00:00:21.450
There, three countries...
Chizeta

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:21.620
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren were
invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Chizeta

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:22.620
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren were
invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:25.120
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren were
invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Tarta Tatra

00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:27.120
...Autozam, Chizeta, and Fahren were
invading in hopes of taking Cephiro.
Fahren

00:00:27.120 --> 00:00:29.120
Sang Yung Chang Ang

00:00:29.120 --> 00:00:31.590
Aska

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:34.260
Lantis

00:00:34.260 --> 00:00:34.860
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Lantis

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.870
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Castle Debonair

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.800
But apparently, another
enemy is after this country.
Debonair

00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:40.870
Debonair...
Debonair

00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:42.870
...and Nova, a girl who
looks just like Ms. Hikaru.
Debonair

00:00:42.870 --> 00:00:44.710
...and Nova, a girl who
looks just like Ms. Hikaru.

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.270
Nova

00:00:45.270 --> 00:00:47.440
I wonder who in the world they are.
Nova

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:48.410
I wonder who in the world they are.

00:00:49.810 --> 00:00:54.770
But now, I am being held
prisoner by those from Fahren.

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:58.940
I have met the princess of
Fahren, Ms. Aska, aboard the Dome.

00:00:59.050 --> 00:01:01.020
What will become of me?

00:01:02.220 --> 00:01:08.630
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:16.460
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:22.280
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:27.440
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:01:28.850 --> 00:01:34.340
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:01:35.520 --> 00:01:38.320
And then the light
that floods down...

00:01:38.660 --> 00:01:45.290
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:53.400
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:01:53.570 --> 00:02:00.640
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:02:00.850 --> 00:02:06.880
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:12.850
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:02:13.860 --> 00:02:20.270
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:02:20.930 --> 00:02:28.200
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:02:31.250 --> 00:02:37.210
Fuu versus Aska!
Life or Death Archery Match

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:10.610
Are you Ms. Aska?

00:03:10.950 --> 00:03:12.350
I am.

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:18.610
I am the first princess
of Fahren, Aska!

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.260
W-Will it be all right?

00:03:21.260 --> 00:03:22.230
W-Will it be all right?
Yes.

00:03:22.330 --> 00:03:26.860
We took everything she was
carrying that could be a weapon.

00:03:27.230 --> 00:03:29.570
I don't think we need to worry, but...

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:33.700
Are you someone from Cephiro?

00:03:34.210 --> 00:03:37.640
No. I come from another world.

00:03:38.450 --> 00:03:39.940
Another world?

00:03:40.050 --> 00:03:41.880
Where is "another world"?

00:03:43.420 --> 00:03:47.050
Lady Aska, this is why
I kept telling you to study!

00:03:48.690 --> 00:03:51.450
Fahren is full of fun people.

00:03:51.630 --> 00:03:53.720
The elder complains too much.

00:03:54.290 --> 00:03:56.990
He is just worried
about you, Ms. Aska.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:03.570
Since you can control such
a strong and cool-looking Rune-God...

00:04:03.670 --> 00:04:05.470
...are you strong too?

00:04:05.640 --> 00:04:08.470
No, I am not strong at all.

00:04:08.610 --> 00:04:11.940
If you're not strong,
how can you control the Rune-God?

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:15.680
The Rune-God is not
something one controls.

00:04:16.080 --> 00:04:18.140
The Rune-God has a heart.

00:04:18.250 --> 00:04:23.350
Because I was accepted
by that heart, we fight together.

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:26.050
Then that Rune-God is alive?

00:04:26.160 --> 00:04:27.090
Yes.

00:04:33.730 --> 00:04:35.930
I want it!

00:04:37.770 --> 00:04:40.330
I want a Rune-God too!

00:04:42.810 --> 00:04:45.780
Girl! Give me
the Rune-God as an offering!

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:49.210
I cannot do that.

00:04:49.950 --> 00:04:51.180
Why not?

00:04:53.820 --> 00:04:58.020
I must protect Cephiro with
the Rune-God and my comrades...

00:04:58.130 --> 00:05:02.620
No, it is because I must
fight for my own heart.

00:05:07.830 --> 00:05:12.240
I definitely, definitely want it!

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.870
How about this?

00:05:16.440 --> 00:05:18.640
Are you proficient in archery?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:21.370
Nobody can beat me in archery.

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:26.040
Then let us have a match. If you win,
I will give you my Rune-God.

00:05:26.490 --> 00:05:31.010
However, if I win, I want
you to return me to Cephiro.

00:05:32.660 --> 00:05:34.130
Is that agreeable?

00:05:34.230 --> 00:05:37.860
If you are not proficient in archery,
I can think of something else.

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:40.990
I am not that good at archery myself.

00:05:41.100 --> 00:05:42.530
I'll do it!

00:05:42.740 --> 00:05:45.760
Lady Aska, you're deciding
such things so hastily.

00:05:46.740 --> 00:05:48.670
Prepare for the match!

00:05:50.010 --> 00:05:51.100
Ms. Hikaru...

00:05:51.340 --> 00:05:52.440
Ms. Umi...

00:05:52.650 --> 00:05:56.380
I will make sure I return,
so stay safe until then.

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:05.340
Where is this?

00:07:10.420 --> 00:07:11.480
Hikaru...

00:07:12.260 --> 00:07:13.190
Hikaru?

00:07:14.560 --> 00:07:15.530
Presea?

00:07:15.860 --> 00:07:17.920
Remember, Hikaru...

00:07:18.060 --> 00:07:20.000
Remember my words...

00:07:25.170 --> 00:07:27.640
At all times, believe in yourself.

00:07:29.710 --> 00:07:32.510
Keep holding on to your wish...

00:07:33.280 --> 00:07:34.410
My...

00:07:41.250 --> 00:07:43.550
My wish.

00:07:44.220 --> 00:07:46.750
Fight against yourself, Hikaru.

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:50.520
Don't let yourself be swallowed
by the shadows. Look at the light.

00:07:51.160 --> 00:07:54.930
That's right. I promised this time...

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:57.600
...to not regret anything!

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:59.600
With Umi and Fuu...

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:02.630
...and with myself!

00:08:03.940 --> 00:08:06.470
I'm going to fight for myself!

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.420
I won't let you go, Hikaru.

00:09:18.550 --> 00:09:19.810
It's near.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:24.380
The evil presence has
grown even stronger.

00:09:24.490 --> 00:09:25.580
And...

00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:30.060
Hikaru's presence feels so weak
that it may disappear any moment.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:38.760
Hikaru...

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:56.450
Hikaru!

00:10:04.230 --> 00:10:06.160
Out of my way!

00:10:07.570 --> 00:10:10.660
Sapphire Whirlwind!

00:10:17.480 --> 00:10:18.470
Hikaru!

00:10:32.930 --> 00:10:35.390
W-What exactly are these things?

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:05.280
Hikaru...

00:11:06.890 --> 00:11:08.830
Did something happen to you?

00:11:10.000 --> 00:11:11.090
Hikaru!

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.190
Uh-oh...

00:11:49.440 --> 00:11:50.960
Beast Summon!

00:12:10.320 --> 00:12:11.590
Ascot...

00:12:14.830 --> 00:12:17.260
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:17.360 --> 00:12:21.840
Fahren
Aska Chang Ang
Sang Yung

00:12:21.840 --> 00:12:24.270
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:12:24.400 --> 00:12:27.810
Chizeta
Tatra Tarta

00:12:39.890 --> 00:12:40.820
Umi!

00:12:42.220 --> 00:12:43.550
Are you okay?

00:12:43.660 --> 00:12:44.920
Ascot...

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:47.090
Why are you here?

00:12:49.030 --> 00:12:51.090
I wanted to save you.

00:12:51.200 --> 00:12:52.460
That's all...

00:13:08.150 --> 00:13:09.770
Beast Summon!

00:13:37.340 --> 00:13:38.330
Ascot.

00:13:41.050 --> 00:13:42.210
Thank you.

00:13:42.950 --> 00:13:46.390
I was saved
by you, Umi. It's my turn now.

00:14:02.940 --> 00:14:04.200
Oh my...

00:14:06.010 --> 00:14:09.000
It looks like someone
came to pick her up.

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:13.810
Oh, he's a cute boy.

00:14:13.910 --> 00:14:16.310
I wonder if he's a friend.

00:14:16.420 --> 00:14:20.010
Tarta, I hope you can
find a boyfriend soon too.

00:14:20.950 --> 00:14:22.550
Shut up!

00:14:23.160 --> 00:14:25.520
You don't have a boyfriend either!

00:14:30.130 --> 00:14:33.460
D-Don't tell me
you do have a boyfriend?

00:14:35.570 --> 00:14:37.430
Sister!

00:14:38.570 --> 00:14:40.100
Tarta...

00:14:41.770 --> 00:14:46.300
I'm sure that you'll find a wonderful
boyfriend just like the djinn!

00:15:27.220 --> 00:15:29.650
And now the rules of the match!

00:15:37.300 --> 00:15:39.660
Whoever shoots down more wins.

00:15:39.770 --> 00:15:41.200
It's Chizeta's...

00:15:41.300 --> 00:15:44.240
Correct.
Those disgusting guardian spirits.

00:15:44.340 --> 00:15:46.670
They couldn't be alive, could they?

00:15:46.770 --> 00:15:49.070
They are created by illusions.

00:15:49.180 --> 00:15:51.770
Fahren has no living things like that!

00:15:52.450 --> 00:15:57.210
If Ms. Umi saw this, I am sure
she would lose all will to fight.

00:16:00.090 --> 00:16:01.680
Bring the bows!

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:12.160
Because you excel at everything
other than your studies...

00:16:12.270 --> 00:16:14.960
...I am sure you will not lose, but...

00:16:15.070 --> 00:16:16.660
I am invincible!

00:16:16.770 --> 00:16:19.290
Is giving her a weapon a good idea?

00:16:19.410 --> 00:16:22.600
It's all right.
I've already taken care of it.

00:16:32.390 --> 00:16:33.610
Here...

00:16:34.490 --> 00:16:36.460
Thank you very much.

00:16:40.760 --> 00:16:41.780
Sang Yung!

00:16:41.890 --> 00:16:42.880
Y-Yes!

00:16:45.770 --> 00:16:47.600
W-What is it?

00:16:47.700 --> 00:16:48.930
Nothing!

00:16:53.910 --> 00:16:56.200
Let's begin!

00:17:30.810 --> 00:17:32.710
Those things are disgusting!

00:17:32.810 --> 00:17:36.580
You were the one who
chose them as targets, Lady Aska!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.960
No trace of doubt with any shot.

00:18:00.570 --> 00:18:05.340
Amazing how she can remain calm,
even in the middle of enemy territory.

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:17.050
On the other hand, Lady Aska...

00:18:40.180 --> 00:18:42.840
It seems I got a few more than you.

00:18:52.490 --> 00:18:57.160
It was a mistake to make
those things the targets after all!

00:18:57.260 --> 00:18:59.460
I will be going now.

00:18:59.830 --> 00:19:01.420
You can't!

00:19:13.450 --> 00:19:17.080
I thought Fahren was a country
with a Chinese atmosphere...

00:19:17.180 --> 00:19:19.950
...but I guess they have ninja as well.

00:19:30.760 --> 00:19:32.490
Capture that girl!

00:19:44.180 --> 00:19:46.240
Winds of Protection!

00:19:54.390 --> 00:19:56.880
Winds of Admonishment!

00:20:00.060 --> 00:20:03.190
What are you doing?
Hurry up and capture her!

00:20:09.240 --> 00:20:10.330
She...

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:16.760
Even though she's cornered,
she won't wound any of her enemies.

00:20:25.420 --> 00:20:27.410
Winds of Protection!

00:21:06.860 --> 00:21:12.700
Wait!

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:14.330
Lady Aska!

00:21:15.840 --> 00:21:18.530
I won't let you go anywhere!

00:21:19.270 --> 00:21:21.710
I have won the match.

00:21:22.110 --> 00:21:23.870
You promised I could go.

00:21:25.110 --> 00:21:28.550
I only lost because I made
those weird things the targets!

00:21:28.650 --> 00:21:30.480
Next time will be different...

00:21:30.580 --> 00:21:33.550
I am sorry,
but I do not have the time.

00:21:52.440 --> 00:21:54.530
I won't let you escape.

00:22:19.060 --> 00:22:24.470
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:25.140 --> 00:22:32.410
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:33.850 --> 00:22:39.410
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:40.120 --> 00:22:43.920
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:44.290 --> 00:22:46.660
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:48.490 --> 00:22:51.790
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:52.160 --> 00:22:55.500
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:55.940 --> 00:23:02.840
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:03.280 --> 00:23:06.680
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:07.010 --> 00:23:15.440
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:18.290 --> 00:23:21.620
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:21.860 --> 00:23:29.930
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:32.000 --> 00:23:38.810
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:49.880
I'm Presea.

00:23:49.990 --> 00:23:52.550
I'm really her sister,
but I'm still Presea.

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:55.180
Stand firm, Hikaru.
Don't lose to yourself.

00:23:55.290 --> 00:23:58.530
Only your heart can revive your sword!

00:23:58.800 --> 00:24:03.060
Oh, by the way, we've gotten lots
of questions about my real name...

00:24:03.170 --> 00:24:05.760
You'll find out if you watch till the end.

00:24:05.870 --> 00:24:08.070
And so, Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:08.170 --> 00:24:09.900
Revive, Hikaru's Sword!

00:24:10.010 --> 00:24:10.540
You have to watch it!

00:24:10.540 --> 00:24:12.010
Revive, Hikaru's Sword!
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:14.550
Revive, Hikaru's Sword!

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:21.480
Who is it today?

00:24:22.520 --> 00:24:24.460
Today, it's Fuu!

00:24:24.560 --> 00:24:25.490
Look forward to the next episode!

00:24:25.490 --> 00:24:28.260
Look forward to the next episode!
Everyone, did you guess correctly?

00:24:28.260 --> 00:24:29.760
Look forward to the next episode!
Till next time!

00:24:29.760 --> 00:24:30.520
Look forward to the next episode!
